# 统一换行符：仓库里和检出后都保持 LF。
# 否则 Windows 上 git 的 core.autocrlf=true 会在每次 add 时刷一堆
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告，被 PowerShell 渲染成红色报错块。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 这些是二进制，别做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
